-- en: "Check whether a spell can be recommended now, allowing a spell whose remaining cooldown ends with the current global cooldown. On Retail and Forever, where cooldown times are secret in combat, readiness comes from the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags instead. This checks cooldown readiness only; it does not check learned status, range or resource usability. Pass evaluation time from evalStart or GetTime()."
L["Check whether a spell can be recommended now, allowing a spell whose remaining cooldown ends with the current global cooldown. On Retail and Forever, where cooldown times are secret in combat, readiness comes from the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags instead. This checks cooldown readiness only; it does not check learned status, range or resource usability. Pass evaluation time from evalStart or GetTime()."] = "Comprueba si un hechizo se puede recomendar ahora, permitiendo un hechizo cuyo tiempo de reutilización restante termine con el tiempo de reutilización global actual. En Retail y Forever, donde los tiempos de reutilización son secretos en combate, la disponibilidad se obtiene en su lugar de los indicadores isEnabled, isActive e isOnGCD, que nunca son secretos. Solo comprueba la disponibilidad del tiempo de reutilización; no comprueba si está aprendido, el alcance ni si hay recursos para usarlo. Pasa el momento de evaluación desde evalStart o GetTime()."
-- en: "Check whether a table has a non-nil value at a key. A stored false value still counts as present; this does not scan table values."
