L["Record with exists=false; recorded=false for known no history; or runner, ratio, or immune with hits/hitsReason. Nil means a required observation is unavailable."] = "Registro con exists=false; recorded=false si se sabe que no hay historial; o runner, ratio o immune con hits/hitsReason. Nil significa que una observación necesaria no está disponible."
