-- en: "Remove entries in place, preserving only keys listed among except values by default. With invert true, remove listed keys and retain unlisted keys. Without an exception list, the default removes every entry and invert true retains every entry. Nil input does nothing."
L["Remove entries in place, preserving only keys listed among except values by default. With invert true, remove listed keys and retain unlisted keys. Without an exception list, the default removes every entry and invert true retains every entry. Nil input does nothing."] = "Elimina entradas en el sitio y, por defecto, conserva solo las claves que aparecen entre los valores de except. Con invert true, elimina las claves indicadas y conserva las no indicadas. Sin lista de excepciones, por defecto elimina todas las entradas e invert true las conserva todas. Una entrada nil no hace nada."
