-- en: "Run the historical health-snapshot trend formula using the live profile history window, clock and legacy rounding service. Preserve its maximum-health transitions, early stop at full or zero health, weighting, errors and return counts. An empty array, or snapshots that record no weighted change, return only zero rather than a 0/0 result; this is the legacy algorithm rather than a validated forecast."
L["Run the historical health-snapshot trend formula using the live profile history window, clock and legacy rounding service. Preserve its maximum-health transitions, early stop at full or zero health, weighting, errors and return counts. An empty array, or snapshots that record no weighted change, return only zero rather than a 0/0 result; this is the legacy algorithm rather than a validated forecast."] = "Ejecuta la fórmula histórica de tendencia de instantáneas de salud usando la ventana de historial del perfil en vivo, el reloj y el servicio de redondeo antiguo. Conserva sus transiciones de salud máxima, la parada temprana con salud completa o nula, la ponderación, los errores y el número de retornos. Una matriz vacía, o instantáneas que no registran ningún cambio ponderado, devuelven solo cero en lugar de un resultado 0/0; es el algoritmo antiguo, no una previsión validada."
